# Nothing secret and nothing local goes into the build context, which is the
# workspace root: a part's own .env sits below it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
todos
*/todos
.git
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
